          "episode_number": 18,
          "name": "A Mirage the Color of Cherry Blossoms",
          "description": "A blond-haired, voluptuous young woman with twin ponytails is spotted on the island. Thinking that Sakura has returned, Jun'ichi, Nemu, and their friends follow Utamaru to see if he leads them to her.",
